<title>USA: Compania de Minas Buenaventura Q1 net up.</title>
<headline>Compania de Minas Buenaventura Q1 net up.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>(results in thousands of Peruvian Nuevos Soles)</p>
<p>			    1997			1996</p>
<p> Net     profit  63,573	 profit  16,852</p>
<p> Oper net  loss  2,600	  profit  3,000</p>
<p> Sales	     43,889		   47,700</p>
<p>Full company name is Compania de Minas Buenaventura SA NOTE: The current first quarter net income includes 64.4 million soles in extraordinary income and extraordinary losses of 29.6 million.</p>
<p>Earnings per ADS for the first three months of 1997 were US$0.35.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
